B.bjK=new A.qO("The Intention and the Ihram","Labbayk Allahumma Hajj \u2014 the talbiya begins everything. What ihram is, when to enter it, what it forbids.","huda-ihram")
B.bjH=new A.qO("Who Must Go, and When","The obligation, the conditions of ability, what to settle before departure, and the reward of an accepted Hajj.","huda-hajj-intro")
