B.apJ=s(["The Family Wing is for parents and guardians. A parent adds a child; a child never needs an account.","We store a first name or nickname you choose, and the child\u2019s lesson and exam progress. Nothing else: no age, photo, voice, contact details or location.","All of it stays on this device. It is not sent to our servers, to Firebase, or to any AI service. Wasia is never given a child\u2019s name.","Questions a child asks Wasia are answered from the app\u2019s own lessons. They go to an AI service only if you turn that on, and you can turn it off again.","You can delete one child, or everything, at any time from the Family Wing. Deleting removes the name and all progress from this device straight away.","There is no advertising, no tracking and no analytics about children in the app."],t.s)
