B.acD=new A.hb(!0,"As-Salaamu Alaikum. I am H\u0101di \u2014 walking beside you as you seek authentic knowledge. Ask me about worship, the Qur'an, or where anything lives in this app. And when the weight is heavy, tell me that too \u2014 I will stay with it.",null,!1,B.b,!1,B.b)
